:''Not to be confused with the [[Bears be Bare (Monthly Event)|event]] of the same name.''
'''Bears Be Bare''' (クマトーク, ''Kumatōku'', '''Bear Talk''') are a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in [[Special Events|Event Stages]]. They were added in [[Version 2.1 Update#Version 2.1.3 Update|Version 2.1.3]].

