==Enemy==
The bearbershop quintet. They have mediocre health but get knocked back quite often, so be wary when relying on a heavy hitter, as they will likely miss. Their attack is quite slow, long-ranged and has a 100% chance to knockback [[Cat Units]]. They dash forward extremely fast before stopping to attack, similarly to [[Cats in a Box (Special Cat)|Cats in a Box]] or [[Doge Dark]]. Individually not very powerful, they are support troops to push you back so others can advance.

==Strategy==
This enemy is not very powerful or dangerous. Because they are mainly just a support unit, they do not require much to defeat. Use any decent attackers to knock them back. Be wary, for as soon as they are knocked back, they attack again!

Use [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]], [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]], [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Mythical Titan Cat]], or any fair-health attacker to defeat this enemy.

